Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Detailed Material Assessment", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737369274502*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c11975b6-d24a-47a4-a106-\
62307eb946f1"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Pure Gold",
 FontWeight->"Plain",
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.98, 0.56, 0.17]]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 3.990737389279467*^9}},
 FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"75fe3122-809b-496f-a5ba-9cf09ac61ed5"],

Cell["\<\
While gold removes the 1,100-year mining impossibility of osmium (taking only \
a third of a year\[CloseCurlyQuote]s global output), its raw asset valuation \
pushes the project budget to a staggering $90.5 Billion.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.9907374211154327`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"32c0d425-2b19-409b-b740-\
565587a9ee9e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Refining",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Far easier than osmium. Gold melts at a manageable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1064", "\[Degree]C"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "3723211d-3521-4946-aeeb-ae116e57eb0d"],
 " and is malleable. It can be cleanly cast into segments and fused together \
without toxic gas hazards."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737470553631*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"30f00d25-9364-456e-9272-\
4e67fc28248b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Security Logistics",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": The true hidden nightmare here is the security. Moving 1,200 tonnes of \
pure gold requires military-grade armored convoys, specialized naval escorts, \
and an underground bunker with security that rival Fort Knox."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737532658947*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"925c9f82-62b8-4002-8aab-\
2483e639cdfc"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Pure Lead",
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.98, 0.56, 0.17]]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737544364781*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8058073c-b976-468e-8f3c-\
d2026553013a"],

Cell["\<\
Lead is dirt cheap ($3.07M for the raw material), but it introduces severe \
mechanical and structural engineering hurdles.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.9907375596042147`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b63c48e5-1e6d-4481-b777-\
a15cb4f15404"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Structural Failure",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Lead is soft and prone to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]creep\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (gradual deformation under mechanical stress). A \
731-tonne sphere of solid lead resting in a cradle will slowly sag under its \
own weight, flattening out over a few years and ruining perfect spherical \
geometry."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737611695416*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"49a936b5-7846-4336-be08-\
f4b59697ff08"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Cradle",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": The civil engineering and cradle requirements are uniquely complex for \
Lead because we would need an active, pressurized fluid or hydraulic cushion \
support to distribute the weight across the entire bottom half of a sphere to \
keep it round."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 
  3.990737664750855*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d5c61d1a-3614-4492-b1a2-\
e03f6a11a9ce"],

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Pure Iron",
 FontColor->RGBColor[0.98, 0.56, 0.17]]], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
   3.9907373598693132`*^9, 3.9907376728022547`*^9}, 
   3.990740055085895*^9},ExpressionUUID->"cc704bb7-eb68-4e41-ab8a-\
1302c5b41be3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Iron is the champion of practicality for this thought experiment. It \
requires the largest physical size (20\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]foot diameter per \
ball) and the highest mass (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1687", " ", "mt"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "446e0872-c436-4bc8-b570-0bb7ef7e3f8a"],
 "), but with Iron, we can take advantage of standard global industrial \
infrastructure."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 3.99073779007156*^9}, {3.990740076204032*^9, 
  3.9907400994667807`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b415ae11-78d6-444b-a4e0-\
d183762bc1ee"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Manufacturing",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": The global steel industry handles this scale daily. The spheres can be \
cast as solid pieces or thick, concentric shells at any major naval shipyard \
or heavy industrial foundry (similar to manufacturing a submarine hull or a \
heavy generator rotor)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 3.990737759903167*^9}, {3.990737797751706*^9, 
  3.990737833183045*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8a8441c7-386d-41e2-97a1-\
075fb0afa573"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Logistics & Engineering",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ": Because Iron can be alloyed for structural integrity (e.g., cast steel), \
it will hold its shape forever without deformation. Supporting it requires a \
standard industrial heavy-load foundation. The civil engineering costs are \
higher simply because of the physical volume and footprint of the nearly 20\
\[NoBreak]-\[NoBreak]foot-wide spheres, but it is a project that any tier-one \
marine construction company could execute within a couple of years for under \
$1 Billion total."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990734853454862*^9, 3.9907348583257513`*^9}, {
  3.9907373598693132`*^9, 3.990737759903167*^9}, {3.990737797751706*^9, 
  3.990737887403131*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"72043401-8aba-4d5b-bb82-\
f073fe6f55ba"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Transport", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9907344560610857`*^9, 
  3.990734457837833*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"97f61ea0-2744-47ab-9972-\
22a318bba44d"],

Cell["\<\
Transporting the balls would require a multi-axle, heavy-transport vehicle, \
like the Scheuerle SPMT (Self-Propelled Modular Transporter), and lifting \
them would require a max-sized crawler crane like the Liebherr LR 13000. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990406199770432*^9, 3.9904062898215313`*^9}, {
  3.990406379681868*^9, 3.990406386534196*^9}, {3.990406621834652*^9, 
  3.9904067455621347`*^9}, {3.990406781631337*^9, 3.990407081149911*^9}, {
  3.990407334857288*^9, 3.9904073377018623`*^9}, {3.990408151727232*^9, 
  3.990408430140114*^9}, {3.990733933683117*^9, 3.990734014250917*^9}, {
  3.9907340678426933`*^9, 
  3.990734132304372*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b32913e3-0ea1-42b5-ad93-\
5792c7dbb9ec"],

Cell["The following Wolfram code backs up the assertions above.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9907379320998287`*^9, 
  3.9907379468937607`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b80d95ae-3dd5-436a-a387-\
0821cabafd40"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
   RowBox[{"ROf\[Rho]", ",", "RSoln"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
