Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Surface Quality & Corona Discharges", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990742455409883*^9, 3.9907426471759863`*^9}, 
   3.990742708797142*^9, {3.990742815321683*^9, 
   3.990742848499463*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac057c87-1511-44da-9fb4-\
a7a7aa696f57"],

Cell["\<\
The surface electric fields for these spheres are around 7.5 \[Times] \
10\:2074 to 1.33 \[Times] 10\:2075  V/m. While this is below the dielectric \
breakdown of dry air (\[TildeTilde]3 \[Times] 10\:2076  V/m), it is highly \
vulnerable to local breakdown. Any microscopic scratch, dust particle, or \
insect landing on the sphere will act as a lightning rod, concentrating the \
local electric field. Also, field concentration will ionize the surrounding \
air, leading to a steady, glowing corona discharge that bleeds the charge \
into the atmosphere. The entire experiment would need to be housed in an \
ultra-high vacuum (UHV) chamber to maintain charge stability. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990742455409883*^9, 3.9907426471759863`*^9}, 
   3.990742708797142*^9, {3.990742815321683*^9, 3.990742938898059*^9}, 
   3.990747259022396*^9},ExpressionUUID->"ac60f387-ed1f-45b5-bf7f-\
39be007f89c3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Background Ionization (Cosmic Rays)", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990742455409883*^9, 3.9907426471759863`*^9}, 
   3.990742708797142*^9, {3.990742815321683*^9, 
   3.990742971575799*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ab1e7a7b-f75a-4062-b9ae-\
d574ade7ee4f"],

Cell["\<\
Even in a perfect vacuum, the spheres will slowly lose charge over time. \
Cosmic rays, solar radiation, and trace radioactive decay in the surrounding \
containment walls will continuously ionize residual gas in the vacuum \
chamber. Additionally, ambient light will trigger the photo-electric effect \
on the metal surfaces, ejecting electrons. We would need an active feedback \
loop using a high-precision electron gun or Van de Graaff generator to \
constantly top off the charge. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.990742455409883*^9, 3.9907426471759863`*^9}, 
   3.990742708797142*^9, {3.990742815321683*^9, 3.990743050315427*^9}, 
   3.990747266859601*^9, {3.9907920971867332`*^9, 3.990792105902508*^9}, {
   3.990792181498364*^9, 3.9907921847314253`*^9}, 
